# sharp ships its native bindings as `@img/sharp-<os>-<arch>` and
# `@img/sharp-libvips-<os>-<arch>` sibling packages. With pnpm's default
# strict isolation, sharp's install/check.js can't resolve them and falls
# back to building from source (which needs node-addon-api and node-gyp,
# neither of which we want as a dependency).
#
# Hoisting just the sharp-related @img/* packages keeps the rest of the
# tree isolated. See https://sharp.pixelplumbing.com/install#pnpm
public-hoist-pattern[]=@img/sharp-*
public-hoist-pattern[]=@img/sharp-libvips-*
